OL,3,GNEWSAFormer student block sold to
OL,4,Aindependent school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former student accommodation block in
OL,7,FNorthampton that was to be turned into
OL,8,F170 affordable homes has been sold to a
OL,9,Fprivate school.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council had
OL,12,Fplanned to adapt the empty
OL,13,FBassett-Lowke Building into homes but
OL,14,Fin 2024 it said the proposal was no
OL,15,Flonger viable, and the building was put
OL,16,Fup for sale.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
