OL,3,GNEWSAFormer student block sold to
OL,4,Aindependent school
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosworth Independent School said it had
OL,7,Fbought the property, formerly part of
OL,8,Fthe University of Northampton, and
OL,9,Fafter "months of planning and
OL,10,Fdiscussions" it confirmed it would be
OL,11,Fturned into a boarding house.
OL,13,FThe Reform UK-led council has been
OL,14,Fapproached for comment.
